"Traefik enruta cada dominio y Let's Encrypt emite y renueva los certificados."
msgstr "Traefik routes every domain and Let's Encrypt issues and renews the certificates."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:259
msgid "Un subdominio por instancia: cliente-20-bd.tudominio.com"
msgstr "A subdomain per instance: client-20-db.yourdomain.com"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:260
msgid "Dominios propios para instancias y apps"
msgstr "Custom domains for instances and apps"

