#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:288
msgid "Plantillas YAML que puedes ajustar o ampliar en"
msgstr "YAML templates you can tweak or extend in"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:307
msgid "Un servidor, todo en Docker"
msgstr "One server, everything in Docker"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:308
msgid ""
"El panel habla con Docker en tu servidor. No hay servicios externos ni "
"agentes que instalar."
msgstr "The dashboard talks to Docker on your server. No external services or agents to install."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:315
msgid ""
"Recibe el tráfico en los puertos 80/443, aplica el SSL y lo dirige por "
"dominio."
msgstr "Receives traffic on ports 80/443, terminates SSL and routes it by domain."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:321
msgid "Interfaz web y API. Encola las operaciones largas."
msgstr "Web interface and API. Queues long operations."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:325
msgid "Despliega, respalda y restaura. Lanza los backups programados."
msgstr "Deploys, backs up and restores. Runs the scheduled backups."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:333
msgid "Instancia «mi-empresa»"
msgstr "Instance “my-company”"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:334
msgid "Odoo + Postgres en su propia red, filestore en un volumen."
msgstr "Odoo + Postgres on their own network, filestore in a volume."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:341
msgid ""
"La base de datos del panel vive en una red interna a la que las instancias "
"no tienen acceso."
msgstr "The dashboard's database lives on an internal network that instances cannot reach."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:353
msgid "En marcha en minutos"
msgstr "Up and running in minutes"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:361
msgid "Un servidor Linux"
msgstr "A Linux server"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:362
msgid ""
"Con acceso root y los puertos 80 y 443 libres. El instalador se encarga de "
"Docker."
msgstr "With root access and ports 80 and 443 free. The installer takes care of Docker."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:366
msgid "Configura el DNS antes"
msgstr "Set up DNS first"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:367
msgid ""
"Crea los registros A de tudominio.com y *.tudominio.com apuntando a la IP "
"del servidor. El instalador te pedirá el dominio y un email, y Traefik "
"genera los certificados HTTPS."
msgstr "Create A records for yourdomain.com and *.yourdomain.com pointing to the server's IP. The installer asks for the domain and an email, and Traefik issues the HTTPS certificates."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:371
msgid "Ejecuta el instalador"
msgstr "Run the installer"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:372
msgid "Genera las claves, configura tu dominio y levanta todos los servicios."
msgstr "It generates the keys, sets up your domain and starts every service."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:376
msgid "Crea tu primera instancia"
msgstr "Create your first instance"

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:377
msgid ""
"La primera cuenta que se registra es la de administrador. Elige versión de "
"Odoo y despliega."
msgstr "The first account to sign up becomes the administrator. Pick an Odoo version and deploy."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:384
msgid ""
"Antes de ejecutarlo, comprueba que tu dominio ya apunta al servidor (por "
"ejemplo con «dig +short tudominio.com»). El instalador lo verifica y te "
"avisa si no es así."
msgstr "Before running it, check that your domain already points to the server (e.g. with “dig +short yourdomain.com”). The installer checks it and warns you if it does not."

#: orchestrator/templates/orchestrator/home.html:389
msgid "Instalación rápida"
msgstr "Quick install"

